  "name": "Fox Form",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/WhiteFox_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have taken the form of a White Fox, granting you speed, stealth, and protection from predators.</p><p>You and your affected allies gain the following effects for as long as they remain within <strong>10 spaces</strong> of you.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Size</strong> becomes <strong>1/2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Stride</strong> speed increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You gain a bonus to your <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Stealth</strong> equal to the <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Metaphysics</strong> of the creature that used this ability.</p></li><li><p>Most animals will ignore you unless you provoke them first.</p></li></ul>",
